# Generated by `node scripts/mobile-source.mjs stamp`; carries the release
# version for the wails mobile generators so the tracked config.yml stays a
# 0.0.0 placeholder and a stamped release tree is not dirty.
/config.stamp.yml
# The stamp is written to a per-process temporary file and renamed into place;
# the temporary file must be ignored too, or a parallel source-state check sees
# it and labels the build "+dirty".
/config.stamp.yml.tmp-*
